.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK WEBHOOK CREATE"
.SH NAME
hamstik webhook create \- Create a webhook endpoint. The signing secret is returned exactly once
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik webhook create [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a webhook endpoint. The signing secret is returned exactly once
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --body-file
Read the JSON request body from this file; `-` reads stdin
.TP
.B --field
Structured JSON field as `key=value`; repeatable
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Idempotency key override
